  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/veyon/veyon/tarball/v4.11.4",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/veyon/veyon/zipball/v4.11.4",
  "body": "* General\r\n  - Updated translations\r\n* Core\r\n  - Added setting for double buffering to always present fully updated framebuffers (#1173 by @AdrienTecher)\r\n  - Improved framebuffer downscaling to avoid artifacts (#1173 by @AdrienTecher)\r\n  - Fixed truncated version string in RFB protocol (#1193 by @Alberto115x)\r\n* Configurator\r\n  - Added setting \"Grid sizing mode\" allowing to configure how thumbnail labels are displayed (full-length/truncated) (#1169)  \r\n* Plugins\r\n  - Demo: only reconnect once if multiple clients lost synchronization + other robustness improvements\r\n  - LDAP: added support for querying user groups through user attribute\r\n  - LDAP: group integration tests and add \"List all user groups\" test\r\n  - WebAPI: present complete framebuffer updates to API clients (#1173 by @AdrienTecher)\r\n* Linux\r\n  - Fixed AuthHelper to only use QSettings without QCoreApplication to properly run with setuid \r\n  - Fixed initial pixel format announced by the PipeWire VNC server (#1175 by @AdrienTecher)\r\n  - Added option to keep the portal restore token for the PipeWire VNC server (#1174 by @AdrienTecher)\r\n* Windows\r\n  - Fixed compatibility issue with Defender 4.18.26090 by making search for a primary user session processes more resilient (#1184, #1189, #1192, #1194, #1195)\r\n  - Made feature worker authentication more reliable by refactoring the way authentication tokens are read from stdin - fixes non-working features such as file transfer, demo mode etc.\r\n  - 3rdparty: libpng: update to 1.6.59\r\n  - 3rdparty: OpenSSL: update to 3.5.9\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/veyon/veyon/compare/v4.11.3...v4.11.4",
